place structure something like:

$x_1 = c_1$ is a railgun/magnetically launched metal slug throwing
weapon for use against x2 by x3; weapon fires metallic object(s) j1
using magnetic ojbect(s) m1

j2 and m2 are dropped due to being mostly useless.

